    <string name="horoscope_section_overview_title">🔮 Overview of the Year 2027</string>
    <string name="horoscope_section_overview_content">2027 is the Year of the Goat (Dinh Mui), characterized by Heavenly River Water (Thien Ha Thuy). This year brings harmonious, compassionate energy, ideal for establishing long-term relationships and sustainable wealth.</string>
    <string name="horoscope_section_departure_title">🧭 First Departure Directions (Day 1)</string>
    <string name="horoscope_section_departure_content">• Joy God: Northwest (welcome joy, luck, family peace)\n• Wealth God: Southeast (attract wealth, career prosperity)\n• Auspicious Hours: Rat (23:00-01:00), Tiger (03:00-05:00), Dragon (07:00-09:00), Snake (09:00-11:00)</string>
    <string name="horoscope_section_color_title">🎨 Lucky Colors for 2027</string>
    <string name="horoscope_section_color_content">• Generating colors (Metal generates Water): White, Gold, Silver\n• Element colors (Water): Blue, Black\n• Auspicious festival colors: Royal Red, Prosperity Gold</string>

